==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|suyvre}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|sivre}}, {{m|fro|siure}}, from {{etyl|VL.|fr}} {{m|la|*sequere}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|sequī}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|sequor}}, cognate with Portuguese/Spanish: ''[[seguir]]''.

